# T4.2 case 3b: the database is back, and `c` on the failed tab connects.
key c
wait busy
expect ●
expect connected in
frame reconnected

# The transition has settled, so the spinner has to be still.
wait 100
wait 100
wait 100
wait 100
wait 100
wait 100
wait 100
wait 100
wait 100
wait 100
wait 100
wait 100
wait 100
wait 100
wait 100
wait 100
wait 100
wait 100
wait 100
wait 100
frame reconnected-idle
key q
